			"Message": "style(Mist): Normalise doc comments and fix indentation in WebSocket\n\nReplace hyphens with em-dashes in doc comments, remove redundant self-referential phrasing (\"This is useful for\" → \"Useful for\", \"will return\" → \"return\"), add missing `# Parameters` and `# Returns` sections to the `invoke` and `notify` methods, and fix the `ConnectWithSecret` method indentation that was double-tabbed.\n\nNo functional changes — documentation and formatting only.",
